reviewer_concerns.value:
Concerns addressed by the rebuttal:
1) The necessary assumptions and conditions for the algorithm's validity are well clarified;
2) Computational cost of the optimization problem;
3) Comparison with related works (e.g., Efroni et. al., 2020);

Concerns remained after the response:
1) Bad regret criteria in the adversarial case;
2) The selection of a crucial parameter $\rho$ is not clear. As a result,  the  "best-of-both-worlds" claim appears overstated;
3) Limited numerical experiments.
